#. column 2: brass sky pirate spoils
#. column 8: When sky pirates raiding in the Sea of Clouds board another vessel, it is tradition to claim a piece of the airship to serve as proof of the deadly deed. These objects of honor and bravery have also been known to be used as currency between the brigands.
#. column 9: Brass Sky Pirate Spoil
msgctxt "Item:13630:0:0"
msgid "brass sky pirate spoil"
msgstr "латунный трофей небесного пирата"

