#. ja: 新生の冒険録
#. de: Ausgabe[p] von „Abenteuergeschichten: A Realm Reborn“
#. fr: exemplaire des “Contes d'aventures<nbsp>: Renaissance éorzéenne”
#. column 2: copies of <i>Tales of Adventure: A Realm Reborn</i>
#. column 8: A detailed record of recent Eorzean history─so detailed, in fact, that all who read it come to swear they experienced the events firsthand.<br><br>Use to instantly complete all main scenario quests up through “Before the Dawn.” Cannot be used outside large settlements. Automatic logout will commence upon usage.
#. column 9: Tales of Adventure: A Realm Reborn
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Item:13991:0:0"
msgid "copy of <i>Tales of Adventure: A Realm Reborn</i>"
msgstr "экземпляр <i>«Путешествия: Перерождение»</i>"

#. de: Ausgaben[p] von „Abenteuergeschichten: A Realm Reborn“
#. fr: exemplaires des “Contes d'aventures<nbsp>: Renaissance éorzéenne”
#. column 0: copy of <i>Tales of Adventure: A Realm Reborn</i>
#. column 8: A detailed record of recent Eorzean history─so detailed, in fact, that all who read it come to swear they experienced the events firsthand.<br><br>Use to instantly complete all main scenario quests up through “Before the Dawn.” Cannot be used outside large settlements. Automatic logout will commence upon usage.
#. column 9: Tales of Adventure: A Realm Reborn
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Item:13991:0:2"
msgid "copies of <i>Tales of Adventure: A Realm Reborn</i>"
msgstr "экземпляры <i>«Путешествия: Перерождение»</i>"

#. ja: エオルゼアにおける冒険の記録。<br>メインクエスト『希望の灯火』までをコンプリートする<br>[都市でのみ使用可能]<br>[使用後、自動的にログアウトする]
#. de: Eine detaillierte Aufzeichnung der jüngeren Geschichte Eorzeas - so detailliert, dass der Leser glaubt, die geschilderten Ereignisse selbst erlebt zu haben.<br><br>Benutze das Buch, um das Hauptszenario bis einschließlich des Auftrags „Nach dem Fall“ abzuschließen. (Kann nicht außerhalb großer Städte verwendet werden. Nach der Benutzung wirst du automatisch ausgeloggt.)
#. fr: Un recueil d'aventures ayant eu lieu en Éorzéa.<br>Permet de terminer l'épopée jusqu'à la quête “Le flambeau de l'espoir”.<br>[Utilisable dans les cités uniquement]<br>[Déconnexion automatique après utilisation]
#. column 0: copy of <i>Tales of Adventure: A Realm Reborn</i>
#. column 2: copies of <i>Tales of Adventure: A Realm Reborn</i>
#. column 9: Tales of Adventure: A Realm Reborn
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:13991:0:8"
msgid "A detailed record of recent Eorzean history─so detailed, in fact, that all who read it come to swear they experienced the events firsthand.<br><br>Use to instantly complete all main scenario quests up through “Before the Dawn.” Cannot be used outside large settlements. Automatic logout will commence upon usage."
msgstr "Подробная летопись недавней истории Эорзеи. Настолько подробная, что каждый, кто её прочтёт, поклянётся, будто сам пережил описанные события.<br><br>Позволяет мгновенно завершить все основные задания вплоть до «Перед рассветом». Можно использовать только в крупных поселениях. После использования произойдёт автоматический выход из игры."

